# Regenerable state of a controlled M1 run: everything below comes back from the frozen seed trace
# plus `run-spec.json`, so it is not committed. The evidence IS committed: per (block, rung)
# {manifest,spec,trace}.json, run-<arm>.json, windows-<arm>.jsonl, machine-state.jsonl,
# loadavg.jsonl, the floor records, the snapshot digests and report.json.
trace.jsonl
seed.jsonl
instance-*
live/
snapshot/*
!snapshot/*.json
pg/
floor/*/floor-*.dat
driver-*.log
probe-*.jsonl
probe-*.log
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
pg.log
stdout.log
